// Ch11 B05 "The Engine" (C, 1 min). L05: from the engine hall's stair head, the Lamp Engine standing
// knee-deep under a grey shaft of daylight, twelve lamps lit steady teal, still trimming for a drowned
// congregation. T02: it turns every lamp toward the party and brightens them in sequence. Two conduit
// crawlers sit dormant on the dais edge from the start (ADR 0204 §8). Then the flow starts the fight.
title: ch11_the_engine
location: ch11/lowlight
---
@letterbox on
@camera L05
@music silence fade=1.0
@sfx engine_tick
@wait 3.0
@camera T02
@anim lamp_engine gather
@music lamp_engine fade=0.5
Pell [worried]: Twelve. And one more. In the middle. #line:ch11_engine_001
Liss [neutral]: She's beautiful. #line:ch11_engine_002
@wait 1.0
Liss [determined]: Break her. #line:ch11_engine_003
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch11_lamp_engine>>
===
